                "entry_id": "f4187a58-5e80-3ca9-8537-6edfca2b4828",
                "word": "adret",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cae4f6ef-211a-4d4f-a46d-a54dc63d20af",
                        "entry_id": "f4187a58-5e80-3ca9-8537-6edfca2b4828",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "adrets"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bdfbea37-8d56-3735-bd3c-1d2bac9e5773",
                        "entry_id": "f4187a58-5e80-3ca9-8537-6edfca2b4828",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The sun-facing side of a mountain; in the northern hemisphere, especially south-facing slope."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d6f54f-c258-488a-9e10-e00b8fb2f8b3",
                                "sense_id": "bdfbea37-8d56-3735-bd3c-1d2bac9e5773",
                                "text": "The distribution of barley is generally on the adret slope, the ubac seeming to be disregarded. A sunny slope is the most important natural factor in the cultivation of barley and wheat. Very rarely they are cultivated in ubac fields, but close investigation showed them to be of secondary adret nature. In this case seeds are sown a month earlier and mown ten days later than on the adret slope."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8322af44-f9d7-4a73-8ab5-7f6b3e79e3dc",
                                "sense_id": "bdfbea37-8d56-3735-bd3c-1d2bac9e5773",
                                "text": "Viticulure in an alpine (Savoie) or sub-alpine environment (like the Jura) is a precarious activity […] Exposure, by contrast, exaggerates or modifies the quantity of the altitudinal elements in terms of ubac (shady) versus adret (sunny) positions, wet and dry positions, or windy and protected positions, respectively. The advantages of adret slopes, which are usually drier and more protected, are evident and of paramount importance. Adret aspects receive much higher levels of direct sunlight, which produces higher soil and plant temperatures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79cf634a-6012-4b50-a25c-ef9e125eeea8",
                                "sense_id": "bdfbea37-8d56-3735-bd3c-1d2bac9e5773",
                                "text": "The vegetation of the Bachelard Valley mainly consists of forests and alpine pastures. Above the tree limit, alpine pastures and bare rock outcrops dominate the landscape. The location of the tree limit depends on factors like slope aspect and lithology. On south-facing slopes (adrets) the tree limit can reach as high as 2400 m, but on the shadowy north-facing slopes it is usually near 2200 m."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b6f65ae-410a-4304-a028-ae8209c39ff1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f4187a58-5e80-3ca9-8537-6edfca2b4828",
                        "source_sense_id": "bdfbea37-8d56-3735-bd3c-1d2bac9e5773",
                        "source_sense_description": "sun-facing side of a mountain",
                        "target_lang_word": "adret",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adret",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab5a59d4-811a-3253-81cc-d3b40fc87ba0",
                                        "entry_id": "ea4bcdec-4cf7-348b-93b0-16401af57ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Versant d’une montagne qui est le mieux exposé au soleil, et donc le versant le plus chaud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0eb6ed5-2cf2-43f6-80b2-d82fc13ee13d",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5a59d4-811a-3253-81cc-d3b40fc87ba0",
                                                "text": "Bien qu’il s’accompagne presque toujours du Chêne sessile et du Chêne pédonculé — le premier formant quelques taches aux adrets ensoleillés, — le Hêtre prédomine sur les autres essences […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77102f92-bf26-485b-8385-5099e6b4b129",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5a59d4-811a-3253-81cc-d3b40fc87ba0",
                                                "text": "Niché au pied de la montagne, le petit village de Versan-sur-Adret accueille l'arrivée de l'étape."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42f2e17b-1b58-4772-9c50-2cce80abf145",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5a59d4-811a-3253-81cc-d3b40fc87ba0",
                                                "text": "L’exposition en adret provoque la disparition du pergélisol et celui-ci s’y réduit comme une peau de chagrin et s’amincit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0da5ecf4-d4c3-4517-ba22-5b62a04ed72d",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5a59d4-811a-3253-81cc-d3b40fc87ba0",
                                                "text": "Si on a fait l’ascension par l’adret, on fera la descente par l’ubac."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
